[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7621.51, "timestamp": "02:07:01", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7624.709, "timestamp": "02:07:04", "text": "ええ、その通りですね。 待って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7626.55, "timestamp": "02:07:06", "text": "マラソンを買ったの？ そうですよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7627.27, "timestamp": "02:07:07", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7629.27, "timestamp": "02:07:09", "text": "はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7641.83, "timestamp": "02:07:21", "text": "ああ、もう一度やらなきゃ。次の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7644.87, "timestamp": "02:07:24", "text": "シーズン、シーズン3をプレイするつもりだ。   お金を稼ぐにはお金を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7652.39, "timestamp": "02:07:32", "text": "私の考えだ。 うん。 グリーンがあと1ポイント獲得すれば試合"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7655.03, "timestamp": "02:07:35", "text": "終了だ。 待って、どうやって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7657.189, "timestamp": "02:07:37", "text": "ゲームをプレイできるの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7659.589, "timestamp": "02:07:39", "text": "でも、Twitterみたいに、もう終わっているはずだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7662.31, "timestamp": "02:07:42", "text": "うーん、わからない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7666.55, "timestamp": "02:07:46", "text": "ゲームだと思う。 ええ、サーバーはまだたくさん残っていますよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7669.51, "timestamp": "02:07:49", "text": "。 じゃあ、その地域に行って、ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7675.109, "timestamp": "02:07:55", "text": "西アジアを見てみます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7678.709, "timestamp": "02:07:58", "text": "ええ、"}]